🚀 JavaScript Learning Journey

📖 About This Folder
 learning JavaScript — from the absolute basics to advanced concepts.

🎯 Goals
To build strong JavaScript fundamentals through daily practice.

🗺️ Roadmap
Phase	Topics
1. Fundamentals	Variables, data types, operators, conditionals, loops, functions
2. DOM & Browser	Selecting elements, events, manipulating the page
3. Intermediate JS	Arrays & objects in depth, scope, closures, `this` keyword
4. Asynchronous JS	Callbacks, Promises, async/await, Fetch API
5. Object-Oriented JS	Classes, prototypes, inheritance
6. Advanced Concepts	ES6+ features, error handling, modules, design patterns
7. Projects	Small apps combining everything learned

📂  Structure
```
javascript/
│
├── day-01-variables-datatypes.js
├── day-02-operators-conditionals.js
├── day-03-loops.js
├── ...
└── README.md
```
🚀 How to Run Code

Using Node.js:

node index.js


